["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bearish Into November. Room to Run After: Why Dan Niles Is Watching Hyperscaler Credit Default Swaps Credit Default Swap (CDS) Hyperscaler Token Agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-excessreturns-ai泡沫何时破-紧盯信用违约互换与token价格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI泡沫何时破？紧盯信用违约互换与token价格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI泡沫终将破裂，但当前估值远低于互联网泡沫时期，Nvidia市盈率仅15倍。真正的风险在于信贷市场，信用违约互换已升至历史高位，预示未来可能的大幅回调。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Sex-reversing frogs, and Europe’s rising rates of a deadly tick-borne disease temperature dependent sex reversal cryptic female choice hyaloma tick Crimean-Congo hemorrhagic fever digital twin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-sciencepod-高温把雌蛙变成雄蛙-种群可能几十年内崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d87d1a4286923056-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">27:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>高温把雌蛙变成雄蛙，种群可能几十年内崩溃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">敏捷蛙的雌性在热浪中几天就发育成睾丸、变成能繁殖的雄蛙，但它们的后代也更容易性逆转，补偿机制失效，模型预测种群数十年内崩溃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候变化</span><span class=\"tag\">性逆转</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI Detection with Max Spero synthetic mirroring humanizer classifier head WildChat\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-oxide-ai-检测不是查文风-是查信息有没有注水/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e86858ac01c0a5f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 检测不是查文风，是查信息有没有注水</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 写作的破绽不是文风，而是输出比输入多出来的「信息注水」。对冲基金大佬的 AI 社论公开认账成了拐点——Pangram 四代误报率约 2.4 万分之一，且模型越收敛反而越好抓。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 检测</span><span class=\"tag\">内容真伪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From 10 Drones a Month to Nearly 100,000 — Inside Ukraine&#x27;s Largest Drone Manufacturer | Marko Kushnir, General Cherry Shahed FPV Interceptor drone Moniya\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-eyeonai-乌克兰最大无人机商-月产近10万架-ai拦截是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6080df200909c386-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">38:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Eye On A.I.</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>乌克兰最大无人机商：月产近10万架，AI拦截是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">乌克兰无人机厂商 General Cherry 月产近10万架，其中拦截无人机以约2000美元成本击落5万美元以上的俄方 Shahed，AI 制导已实战，但全自主仍遥远。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">无人机</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Wow! Signal: Alien Message, Cosmic Fluke, or SETI’s Best False Alarm? transit telescope hydrogen line water hole maser side lobe technosignature\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-isaacarthur-wow信号近50年没落定-它像外星呼叫-却再没来第二声/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5655ebd36cb58413-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">35:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>WOW信号近50年没落定：它像外星呼叫，却再没来第二声</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1977年那段72秒的窄带氢线信号从未复现，够不到外星文明证据的门槛；它的遗产不是答案，而是提醒我们：在噪声宇宙里，发现与证明之间隔着整条银河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">射电天文</span><span class=\"tag\">SETI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can a land value tax fix housing? | Lars Doucet Land Value Tax (LVT) Georgism YIMBY Mass Appraisal Single Tax Natural Dividend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-moneymacro-土地不是商品-地价税为何能根治住房危机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/125e287967146306-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">MoneyMacro</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>土地不是商品：地价税为何能根治住房危机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">住房短缺只是表象，真正的病灶是土地垄断：地价税把税负从建筑转移到土地，逼着囤地者开发或卖地，让地段价值回归社会，而不是养肥地主。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地价税</span><span class=\"tag\">住房危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Paul Graham On Startups, Ambition, and Great Founders formidable frighteningly ambitious jagged frontier founder mode YC GDP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-ycsp-驱动创始人的不是当亿万富翁-是怕服务器半夜崩掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/516c0e86f9dca57d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>驱动创始人的不是当亿万富翁，是怕服务器半夜崩掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多数人以为撑过创业的是财富野心。Paul Graham 说日常真正推着人走的是灾难恐惧——服务器崩了、模型火车快掉下桌子；埋头十年抬头一算，才发现按上一轮估值自己已经是亿万富翁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业方法论</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人特质</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $100B Niches Hiding Inside Payments MDR APR deferred interest B2B2C secure enclave factoring\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-a16z-支付里没有小于千亿美元的小众市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>支付里没有小于千亿美元的小众市场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">支付是全世界最大的市场，任何你以为最窄的切口一算都是千亿美元；但金额越大抽成越小，真正赚钱的是小额高频。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付</span><span class=\"tag\">消费信贷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Redefining Chip Architecture with Arm CEO Rene Haas IP licensing compute subsystem RTL GDSII\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-nopriors-arm-下场造-cpu-芯片设计最大瓶颈是验证-不是设计/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e36b80375fbfde6c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>Arm 下场造 CPU：芯片设计最大瓶颈是验证，不是设计</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">芯片周期真正的耗时大头是验证、调试和文档，不是 RTL；Arm 已有 80%-90% 工程师每天用 AI，并打破 98.5% 毛利的授权模式亲身下场造 CPU。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Arm</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Ethics Problem in Financial Services (Dr. Moira Somers &amp; Philippa Hann) | Rational Reminder 425 ACFE CFP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-rationalreminder-金融舞弊头号预警-不是贪婪-是个人财务先失控/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2de1b986a9bfa34c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>金融舞弊头号预警：不是贪婪，是个人财务先失控</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ACFE 连续 14 年把「个人财务问题」列为财务违规的第一预警信号；系统激励、批判脑区下线与道德高估，都会让好人一步步越界。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融伦理</span><span class=\"tag\">财务顾问</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How Sonos rebooted itself MCP Sonos Fabric TruePlay NPI Custom Agents\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-decoder-sonos-把音箱变成家里的电脑-赌的是智能体时代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/ef824876-cfc6-11f0-83c5-2fee08fa8068/image/8ae0753c40857d78c036a8bf04ab3d89.jpg?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&amp;max-w=3000&amp;max-h=3000&amp;fit=crop&amp;auto=format,compress&amp;w=400&amp;auto=format\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>Sonos 把音箱变成家里的电脑，赌的是智能体时代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sonos 不再卖单个音箱，而是卖一套系统：17 亿台设备组成的家庭算力网，用 MCP 接入外部 AI，用自定义智能体让多个助手在同一平台共存。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能家居</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 助手</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How the Planet-Altering Disaster of “Forever Chemicals” Was Kept Secret PFAS PFOS Scotchgard forever chemicals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-papertrail-3m-早就知道-却让一位科学家以为自己错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88c11f238ad040c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>3M 早就知道，却让一位科学家以为自己错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">3M 在 1970 年代就知道 PFOS 已进入普通人血液，却让发现它的年轻科学家被反复质疑到放弃。秘密不是靠销毁文件保住的，是靠让知情者自己闭嘴。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span><span class=\"tag\">PFAS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Empress Dowager Cixi self-strengthening movement Hundred Days Reform Boxer Rebellion Datong century of humiliations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-inourtime-慈禧不是改革派也不是守旧派-她只要大清活下去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b92ca842f2a04535-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">51:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>慈禧不是改革派也不是守旧派，她只要大清活下去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她支持洋务、办京师大学堂、废科举，前提是这些改革不威胁王朝和她自己的权力；一旦改革逼近革命，她立刻翻脸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">晚清</span><span class=\"tag\">慈禧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Jonathan Quong, &quot;Political Philosophy: The Puzzle of Legitimate Injustice&quot; (Princeton UP, 2026) legitimate injustice ordinary laws service conception normal justification thesis weighing problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-nbphilosophy-不公正的法律也能合法-正义要求我们分担不正义的代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1c8789e8a81bb90f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">New Books in Philosophy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>不公正的法律也能合法：正义要求我们分担不正义的代价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真诚善意的人对正义要求什么必然分歧，因此任何政治共同体都会犯错；这些错误是集体责任，不该让执行法律的一线官员独自承担。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">法理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s Behind the Big Surge in US Government Bond Yields term premium fiscal dominance off-the-run Treasuries ratchet effect Treasury General Account (TGA)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-oddlots-美债利率上-5-不是通胀闹的-32-万亿国债让买家只肯加价接盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">36:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>美债利率上 5% 不是通胀闹的：32 万亿国债让买家只肯加价接盘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通胀解释不了 30 年期破 5%：即便无通胀无违约风险，已在 5.3% 配满美债的买方也不会为新增 100 亿动心。真正推高曲线的是每年再增 2 万亿的国债供给，财政部想靠回购压也压不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美债收益率</span><span class=\"tag\">国债回购</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The school report that changed public education achievement gap educational inputs educational outputs white flight No Child Left Behind Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-throughline-教育不平等的主因不是学校资源-是家庭和同学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2901x2901+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F68%2F5b%2F562c19574816b20deb64d8e888b8%2Fd048b05b-c262-4f5d-b309-8f5ff2eef3d4.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">36:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>教育不平等的主因不是学校资源，是家庭和同学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1966年那份700页的联邦报告本想证明「穷学校缺钱」，数据却指向另一个答案：家庭社会经济背景和课堂里的阶层混合，才是学生成绩最强的预测因子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育政策</span><span class=\"tag\">社会流动性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Everyone wants to be your wallet ACH interchange Durbin-exempt institution bps / bips\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-complexsys-钱包的利润密码不是余额利息-是钱在体系内流转/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/939355004e704d04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">33:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>钱包的利润密码不是余额利息，是钱在体系内流转</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">钱包的核心账：转进来要付卡组织通道费，体系内互转近乎免费，出金还能再收；它赚的是流动价差而不是沉淀利息，PayPal、Cash App、Stripe Link 都在赌这个模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付</span><span class=\"tag\">钱包</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"I’ll Believe in AGI When It Solves Quantum Gravity | Prof. Rajesh Gopakumar | Theoretical Physicist Quantum gravity String theory Bose-Einstein condensation Synthesizability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-spc-解不出量子引力-就不算真正的-agi/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00b7c1ae9f5f7539-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">South Park Commons</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>解不出量子引力，就不算真正的 AGI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理学家给 AGI 划了一条高线：解出量子引力才算数。这场对话还讲清量子材料与 AI 的真实关系——搜索到的材料要过了可合成一关，结果可能剩零个。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">弦理论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Rise &amp; Fall of Babylon cuneiform lex talionis ziggurat theophoric name Amorites\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-historyhit-巴比伦被圣经写成了罪恶之城-其实它是第一个启蒙都市/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://assets.pippa.io/shows/6215f67d4b795a40fffd3b2c/1788258118144-59c1d44e-0f9f-4cce-846d-8fb80570cfe2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">48:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>巴比伦被圣经写成了罪恶之城，其实它是第一个启蒙都市</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴比伦的恶名来自犹太流亡记忆与《启示录》对罗马的影射，而它真实身份是人口五万、天文学领先希腊的国际化大都市。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代史</span><span class=\"tag\">美索不达米亚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"507 – Law and Order: Normandy chivalry Magna Carta vicomte\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-britishhist-亨利一世不杀弟弟-却发明了国王随意关人的先例/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">32:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>亨利一世不杀弟弟，却发明了国王随意关人的先例</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利一世把亲弟弟和表弟无限期关进宫殿，没罪名、没审判。他破了骑士规则，也埋下了《大宪章》里两条禁止国王随意抓人的条款。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世纪</span><span class=\"tag\">诺曼底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"153. 和曾鸣聊产业史观：残酷的真相、会消亡的公司、优秀≠卓越、“OAI、Anth大概率不是原生时代大赢家” Token factory Agentic OS New Lab High agency Context not control\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-zhangxiaojun-ai没有安全巨头-公司制度将消亡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2be28ff846f98de7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珲·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 领跑者只是炼油厂，不是原生应用大赢家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI进入智能体阶段：第一阶段领跑者只是炼油厂，不是原生应用大赢家；新平台不来自旧平台，组织要从岗位转向任务，最后人拼的是无中生有的创造力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI产业</span><span class=\"tag\">战略方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"702. Roman Civil War: The Barbarian Invasion (Part 2) novus homo terror kimbricus publicani latifundia Sochi Felix\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-restishistory-罗马最危险的敌人不是蛮族-是打赢蛮族的那个人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>罗马最危险的敌人不是蛮族，是打赢蛮族的那个人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马略靠连任五届执政官击退条顿人与辛布里人，却把罗马宪政传统踩在脚下；苏拉用同样路径崛起，最终把矛头对准罗马自己。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">内战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"392. Road To 9/11: Bin Laden vs Saudi Arabia (Part 4) Awakening Sheikhs Alex Station\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-empirehist-本-拉登被沙特抛弃后-为何在苏丹过得最好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">43:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登被沙特抛弃后，为何在苏丹过得最好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被剥夺国籍、被家族断绝关系、被美国盯上，本·拉登却在苏丹建起自己的商业与武装网络——直到美国逼苏丹把他赶走。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东</span><span class=\"tag\">恐怖主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money Fan Favorite: Looking Past Market Cap Weighted Indexes cap weighted index fundamental index / RAFI rebalancing alpha tracking error flip-flops\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-mastersinbiz-市值加权指数在追高-被动投资里藏着主动交易/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef5a885f6888ef87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">18:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>市值加权指数在追高：被动投资里藏着主动交易</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市值加权指数不是被动，它按价格配权重、追涨杀跌，光指数调整的交易成本每年就吃掉15个基点；基本面加权指数20年跑赢市值加权价值指数每年2%以上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指数投资</span><span class=\"tag\">市值加权</span>\n</div></div></a>"]